  "chitchat": [
    "\"Coffee's fresh. Well. It's hot. Same thing, after a while.\"",
    "\"You want it cheap or you want it good? Pick one. This is a ration store.\"",
    "\"Everything's a ration, friend. We just shelve it.\""
  ],
  "description": "A broad, unhurried counterman with a paper hat gone limp and an apron worn to a shine. He restocks and rings up without ever seeming to hurry.",
  "dialogue_tree": {
    "bye": {
      "options": [],
      "text": "He turns back to the register."
    },
    "oranges": {
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "And where does the distribution center get the oranges from?",
          "next": "oranges_deeper"
        },
        {
          "label": "Huh. Thanks.",
          "next": "root"
        }
      ],
      "text": "\"The distribution center.\" He says it the way you'd say the day of the week, already reaching past you for the next thing on the belt."
    },
    "oranges_deeper": {
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "Right. Never mind.",
          "next": "root"
        },
        {
          "label": "(say nothing)",
          "next": "bye"
        }
      ],
      "text": "Dell's hand stops on the belt.\n\nHe looks at the orange in your grip, and then at the crate of them by the chiller, stamped and dated and perfectly ordinary, and something moves behind his face that he clearly hasn't had cause to feel in a long time.\n\n\"I...don't know,\" he says.\n\nHe wipes his palms on the apron, twice, though they're dry. \"Truck comes Tuesdays,\" he offers, to himself more than to you, and starts counting the till again from the beginning."
    },
    "root": {
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "What's on the menu?",
          "next": "shop"
        },
        {
          "conditions": [
            {
              "item": "item_orange",
              "op": "has"
            }
          ],
          "label": "Where do these oranges come from?",
          "next": "oranges"
        }
      ],
      "text": "\"Aisles are where they are. Prices on the shelf, cash on the counter.\""
    },
    "shop": {
      "actions": [
        {
          "action": "OPEN_SHOP",
          "npcId": "npc_ration_cook"
        }
      ],
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "(look it over)",
          "next": "bye"
        }
      ],
      "text": "\"Counter's open. Point at what you want.\""
    }
  },
